WEBVTT

00:14.130 --> 00:16.750
<b>HS 2nd Year
Kanon Kougami</b>

00:14.750 --> 00:15.790
<b>It's no good.</b>

00:15.790 --> 00:18.500
<b>We aren't even scratching 
that thing like this.</b>

00:16.750 --> 00:19.630
<b>HS 2nd Year
Shiho Kunieda
HS 2nd Year
Kanon Kougami</b>

00:19.790 --> 00:21.920
<b>Wait... What's going on?</b>

00:21.920 --> 00:23.380
<b>Did it stop...?</b>

00:23.380 --> 00:25.960
<b>I have a bad feeling about this.</b>

00:26.880 --> 00:28.080
<b>Where's Misaki?</b>

00:30.130 --> 00:32.790
<b>HS 1st Year
Misaki</b>

00:36.710 --> 00:37.880
<b>Look out!</b>

00:39.420 --> 00:41.170
<b>You can almost feel the energy 
pouring from that thing.</b>

00:41.170 --> 00:42.170
<b>We're falling back!</b>

01:00.540 --> 01:03.420
<b>It would seem they are enjoying 
their little present.</b>

01:03.830 --> 01:07.500
<b>An Irous like this should 
truly not even exist.</b>

01:07.960 --> 01:12.330
<b>Now, let's see if you can 
face the despair it brings.</b>

01:15.830 --> 01:17.040
<b>Hoshimori.</b>

01:17.040 --> 01:20.210
<b>Donning their celestial suits with
the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

01:20.210 --> 01:25.040
<b>they stand as humanity's only hope
against the mysterious Irous invaders.</b>

01:25.790 --> 01:31.080
<b>And this, this is the story of both
their battles and their comradery.</b>

01:34.790 --> 01:40.830
<b>Now among the stars that stretch as far as the eye can see,
find the constellation of your dreams</b>

01:40.830 --> 01:49.290
<b>Bring your hearts together 
and someday it will come true</b>

01:57.580 --> 02:02.540
<b>Are you ready to run for it?</b>

02:03.000 --> 02:08.080
<b>The road is long, but you've 
got your friends with you</b>

02:08.500 --> 02:12.790
<b>Instead of just making faces and worrying</b>

02:12.790 --> 02:17.710
<b>Just go in head-first with a smile</b>

02:18.290 --> 02:23.750
<b>As hearts cross even in mere passing</b>

02:23.750 --> 02:26.500
<b>They will grow into deeper bonds</b>

02:26.500 --> 02:33.630
<b>Bring them together as one and find 
the power to take on the future</b>

02:34.290 --> 02:40.130
<b>Now look up to the stars as far as the eye can see
and keep chasing that dream</b>

02:40.130 --> 02:45.540
<b>That outreached hand will 
encourage you not to give up</b>

02:45.540 --> 02:51.040
<b>No matter how many hundreds of 
tries it takes, you're not alone</b>

02:51.040 --> 02:58.040
<b>You can do it, look up, 
there's surely a starry sky</b>

02:58.040 --> 03:00.880
<b>Your dreams will come true</b>

03:03.000 --> 03:08.000
<b>Episode 7
Protective Power</b>

03:09.960 --> 03:11.250
<b>Sorry!</b>

03:12.080 --> 03:15.540
<b>You're so late! We already 
finished our meeting.</b>

03:15.540 --> 03:18.380
<b>Morning practice just went a 
little longer than expected...</b>

03:18.500 --> 03:21.290
<b>HS 1st Year
Miki Hoshitsuki</b>

03:18.830 --> 03:20.460
<b>I'm really sorry.</b>

03:20.460 --> 03:24.630
<b>Miki, you really went 
and blew it this time...</b>

03:24.630 --> 03:26.790
<b>B-blew what...?</b>

03:26.960 --> 03:32.130
<b>Today's meeting was vital to
the very future of our lacrosse club!</b>

03:33.670 --> 03:36.080
<b>Now repent your deeds!</b>

03:36.080 --> 03:40.630
<b>You can start by getting us some of next week's
special Popping Cream double scoop</b>

03:40.630 --> 03:42.920
<b>and make it large size!</b>

03:42.920 --> 03:44.380
<b>I'm really, really sorry!</b>

03:44.630 --> 03:47.170
<b>Oh Miki, don't mind her.</b>

03:47.170 --> 03:49.100
<b>Yeah, we had a meeting,</b>

03:49.100 --> 03:52.050
<b>but it was mostly just like "Make sure to clean up after practice" and stuff.</b>

03:52.920 --> 03:55.460
<b>Kei! Come on, you gave it away too fast!</b>

03:56.420 --> 03:58.920
<b>Anyway, did you remember to bring lunch?</b>

04:00.040 --> 04:02.210
<b>Well come on then, have a seat already!</b>

04:02.210 --> 04:03.880
<b>Lunch break is almost over!</b>

04:03.880 --> 04:06.380
<b>Been a while since we all ate together, huh?</b>

04:08.790 --> 04:10.790
<b>It's almost unbelievably powerful.</b>

04:11.580 --> 04:14.500
<b>Thank goodness that was out in
one of the still undeveloped areas.</b>

04:14.500 --> 04:17.330
<b>What readings do we have 
on the Irous since then?</b>

04:17.830 --> 04:23.290
<b>It appears that after it uses that attack
it needs a period of sleep to recover its energy.</b>

04:23.630 --> 04:26.330
<b>Then we should get out and hit it
while we have the chance!</b>

04:26.330 --> 04:28.700
<b>No, it's not likely we 
could do anything at all.</b>

04:31.380 --> 04:32.670
<b>It's transparent...?</b>

04:32.670 --> 04:34.540
<b>How is this even possible?</b>

04:35.040 --> 04:36.670
<b>We don't know how exactly,</b>

04:36.960 --> 04:41.170
<b>but it seems like half of its body is on
an entirely different plane of existence.</b>

04:41.750 --> 04:43.250
<b>A "different plane of existence"?</b>

04:43.250 --> 04:46.460
<b>To put it simply,
there's absolutely nothing we can do to it.</b>

04:46.670 --> 04:51.210
<b>Which means our only chance is
the next time it moves back into action.</b>

04:51.670 --> 04:54.210
<b>We must come up with a plan before then.</b>

04:54.960 --> 04:58.460
<b>With that kind of power and now
this special hibernation mode...</b>

04:59.000 --> 05:00.750
<b>This has got to be another 
completely new type.</b>

05:01.210 --> 05:04.380
<b>Why are they appearing so often now...?</b>

05:06.710 --> 05:09.290
<b>Wha-? You just brought 
some bread from the store?</b>

05:09.750 --> 05:15.000
<b>I mean, I wanted to make some lunch to bring today,
but I was on-call for a mission you see...</b>

05:15.000 --> 05:16.170
<b>Oh...</b>

05:16.170 --> 05:18.250
<b>Must be tough being part of Hoshimori.</b>

05:18.500 --> 05:22.750
<b>Oh, not at all. We're just doing what
needs to be done, that's all.</b>

05:23.040 --> 05:25.750
<b>And I've got you two supporting me.</b>

05:25.750 --> 05:27.750
<b>I've never really even thought 
about it as being tough.</b>

05:28.960 --> 05:30.960
<b>Miki! Here, eat this!</b>

05:30.960 --> 05:32.420
<b>Huh? Why?</b>

05:32.420 --> 05:33.630
<b>Just do it!</b>

05:33.630 --> 05:35.540
<b>You can have my little octo-dog here too!</b>

05:39.580 --> 05:41.000
<b>So good!</b>

05:41.000 --> 05:42.420
<b>Now for that octo-dog!</b>

05:45.460 --> 05:46.580
<b>Know what?!</b>

05:47.040 --> 05:50.330
<b>Once my retreat is finished
I'll make lunches for both of you!</b>

05:50.330 --> 05:52.170
<b>You know? I think I'm all right.</b>

05:52.170 --> 05:53.880
<b>Yeah, the thought is good enough for me.</b>

05:53.880 --> 05:54.830
<b>Why?</b>

05:55.290 --> 05:56.420
<b>Miki!</b>

05:57.750 --> 05:59.330
<b>We just got word from the lab.</b>

05:59.330 --> 06:01.040
<b>They're calling up an emergency meeting.</b>

06:01.040 --> 06:03.880
<b>Really? Is that Irous on the move again?</b>

06:03.880 --> 06:06.630
<b>Not quite, but we're meeting 
up to discuss just that.</b>

06:06.630 --> 06:08.290
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

06:08.580 --> 06:11.580
<b>Sorry, girls. I promise 
I'll make it up to you!</b>

06:13.500 --> 06:14.630
<b>Miki!</b>

06:14.920 --> 06:16.330
<b>Go get 'em!</b>

06:16.330 --> 06:17.830
<b>Good luck out there!</b>

06:17.830 --> 06:18.750
<b>Thanks!</b>

06:25.420 --> 06:26.790
<b>So as you can see,</b>

06:26.790 --> 06:31.500
<b>our only chance for an attack
is when it starts moving again.</b>

06:32.000 --> 06:36.710
<b>But it's armor is nearly impenetrable,
and unfocused attacks are not going to do the trick.</b>

06:37.130 --> 06:40.830
<b>That's why we called you all here,
to hear out any ideas.</b>

06:40.960 --> 06:43.420
<b>HS 1st Year
Haruka Narumi</b>

06:41.170 --> 06:43.000
<b>Our ideas...?</b>

06:44.130 --> 06:47.290
<b>JH 2nd Year                                                                  JH 2nd Year
Michelle Watagi                                                         Kaede Sendoin</b>

06:47.710 --> 06:51.080
<b>HS 2nd Year                                      HS 2nd Year                                      HS 2nd Year
Nozomi Amano                               Yuri Himukai                                     Kurumi Tokiwa</b>

06:48.750 --> 06:50.920
<b>If we can't take it down,</b>

06:50.920 --> 06:53.830
<b>maybe we could just dig a big 
hole and bury it instead?</b>

06:53.830 --> 06:54.830
<b>That's it!</b>

06:55.000 --> 06:58.330
<b>But that would require quite a large hole.</b>

06:58.330 --> 07:01.920
<b>HS 3rd Year                                                                      HS 3rd Year
Renge Serizawa                                                              Asuha Kusunoki</b>

06:58.710 --> 07:01.920
<b>We don't have the time nor the 
technical capacity for that.</b>

07:01.920 --> 07:03.670
<b>Guess not then...</b>

07:03.790 --> 07:08.670
<b>Well, why don't we get a really big bomb
and blast it to bits?</b>

07:08.670 --> 07:09.750
<b>That's it!</b>

07:09.750 --> 07:13.210
<b>And just where would we get something like that?
Let's be realistic here!</b>

07:13.330 --> 07:15.000
<b>Guess not then...</b>

07:15.000 --> 07:17.630
<b>Nozomi you need to try and
actually think this through too.</b>

07:17.630 --> 07:21.790
<b>I know this is a brand new type of Irous,
but we just don't have enough information.</b>

07:21.790 --> 07:23.630
<b>Indeed.</b>

07:24.250 --> 07:27.210
<b>It's like it's from a completely 
different universe.</b>

07:27.420 --> 07:30.290
<b>We hardly know a thing about it.</b>

07:30.290 --> 07:33.790
<b>We're not going to figure 
anything out just talking here.</b>

07:35.790 --> 07:39.750
<b>You're right. Talking isn't 
going to get us anywhere.</b>

07:40.420 --> 07:43.920
<b>We might be better off 
jumping into action now!</b>

07:43.920 --> 07:46.290
<b>We've managed to get through
everything else so far, right?</b>

07:46.290 --> 07:48.750
<b>As long as we all work 
together we should be fine!</b>

07:49.580 --> 07:53.080
<b>Yeah! We won't get anywhere 
if we just give up here!</b>

07:53.420 --> 07:54.580
<b>Oh yes! Justice shall always prevail!</b>

07:54.580 --> 07:55.960
<b>Just work together...?
Oh yes! Justice shall always prevail!</b>

07:55.960 --> 07:56.630
<b>Just work together...?
Watch and see, Urara will put it out of its misery!</b>

07:56.630 --> 07:58.920
<b>Against... that thing?
Watch and see, Urara will put it out of its misery!</b>

07:58.920 --> 07:59.460
<b>Against... that thing?</b>

08:01.000 --> 08:04.210
<b>They want to fight that 
thing with brute force?</b>

08:08.380 --> 08:10.460
<b>You lot really are something...</b>

08:10.460 --> 08:13.290
<b>Itsuki, would you mind 
bringing up that data for me?</b>

08:13.290 --> 08:16.130
<b>Oh, yes. It's still 
undergoing analysis, but...</b>

08:16.750 --> 08:21.540
<b>During the last blast, we discovered
an area where it collects energy.</b>

08:21.540 --> 08:23.460
<b>A likely weak spot, right on its head.</b>

08:23.460 --> 08:27.460
<b>Now if we can just focus
everyone's attacks on this location...</b>

08:26.170 --> 08:28.880
<b>HS 1st Year
Subaru Wakaba</b>

08:27.460 --> 08:28.880
<b>Really?</b>

08:29.130 --> 08:31.080
<b>It's a very optimistic 
take though I'm afraid.</b>

08:31.080 --> 08:35.080
<b>We'll keep running our analyses here,
so you girls do what you can.</b>

08:54.290 --> 08:58.210
<b>Just like we talked about earlier,
there's still too much we don't know about this target.</b>

08:58.210 --> 09:00.880
<b>I want you to promise you won't
go overboard, you hear me?</b>

09:00.880 --> 09:02.330
<b>Listen up girls.</b>

09:02.330 --> 09:05.330
<b>If we can just destroy that armor
it will be like any other Irous.</b>

09:05.330 --> 09:07.210
<b>There's no Irous we can't beat!</b>

09:07.210 --> 09:10.290
<b>Sure sounds easier than it probably is...</b>

09:12.670 --> 09:13.920
<b>Don't lose hope!</b>

09:14.210 --> 09:16.170
<b>You girls can do this!</b>

09:16.170 --> 09:18.580
<b>I've never given up hope on you!</b>

09:20.670 --> 09:23.000
<b>Sounds like some lame line out of a movie!</b>

09:23.000 --> 09:25.330
<b>You've convinced absolutely no one!</b>

09:26.500 --> 09:29.830
<b>But thank you, sir!</b>

09:35.330 --> 09:36.630
<b>Move out!</b>

09:43.630 --> 09:46.500
<b>Now, let the games begin.</b>

09:47.040 --> 09:51.000
<b>Urara Hasumi (3rd Year JH)
Birthday: February 3rd
Sign: Aquarius
Blood Type: B
Measurements: 82/54/80
Height: 150cm
Weight: 38kg
Hobby: Cosplay
Dream Job: Pop Star
Ideal Downtime:
Reading all the latest pop star gossip
Favorite Food: Marshmallows</b>

09:51.080 --> 09:55.040
<b>Kokomi Asahina (3rd Year JH)
Birthday: October 2nd
Sign: Libra
Blood Type: A
Measurements: 89/62/87
Height: 154cm
Weight: 44kg
Hobby: Stargazing
Dream Job: Astronomer
Ideal Downtime:
Reading books on the stars
Favorite Food: Cream Stew</b>

09:56.460 --> 09:58.750
<b>All right girls, just stick to the plan!</b>

09:58.960 --> 09:59.790
<b>Roger!</b>

10:03.250 --> 10:04.880
<b>And so it begins...</b>

10:06.630 --> 10:08.250
<b>So hard!</b>

10:19.000 --> 10:20.540
<b>That's some armor it's got!</b>

10:23.670 --> 10:24.960
<b>This is too reckless.</b>

10:26.710 --> 10:28.380
<b>Hold it right there!</b>

10:28.380 --> 10:30.380
<b>I think we're in for a long battle...</b>

10:31.290 --> 10:34.670
<b>HS 3rd Year
Anko Tubuzaki</b>

10:31.420 --> 10:34.960
<b>As long as we all work together 
we'll surely find a way!</b>

10:52.580 --> 10:53.580
<b>What now...?!</b>

10:57.420 --> 10:58.500
<b>Are you all right?!</b>

10:58.500 --> 11:00.170
<b>S-sorry about that...</b>

11:02.580 --> 11:03.500
<b>Girls!</b>

11:03.750 --> 11:06.210
<b>Where do its secrets end...?</b>

11:11.210 --> 11:12.960
<b>No one mentioned anything like this!</b>

11:18.130 --> 11:21.000
<b>How dare you kick up all this dirt!</b>

11:18.580 --> 11:20.830
<b>JH 3rd Year
Urara Hasumi</b>

11:21.000 --> 11:23.630
<b>Oh yes! Absolutely unforgivable!</b>

11:30.630 --> 11:31.920
<b>Kokomi!</b>

11:39.170 --> 11:41.040
<b>You truly saved me there, Mimi.</b>

11:42.040 --> 11:47.790
<b>We must do whatever it takes to draw its attention
and support our girls out in front!</b>

11:47.790 --> 11:49.420
<b>Yup! I know!</b>

11:50.630 --> 11:52.880
<b>The Irous is beginning to slow down.</b>

11:53.080 --> 11:55.250
<b>It's drawing close to the 
residential area now.</b>

11:55.250 --> 11:57.250
<b>Do you think we can hold it off?</b>

11:57.380 --> 11:59.460
<b>What's the situation?</b>

11:59.920 --> 12:01.130
<b>Ms. President!</b>

12:01.130 --> 12:03.460
<b>The Hoshimori girls are still fighting back.</b>

12:04.250 --> 12:07.420
<b>Thanks to all their hard work
we seem to have held it still for now.</b>

12:07.920 --> 12:09.960
<b>But we need more time before we can attack.</b>

12:12.000 --> 12:15.580
<b>Issue an evacuation order to all students
and all nearby civilians.</b>

12:15.580 --> 12:16.460
<b>Ms. President!</b>

12:16.750 --> 12:20.880
<b>This Irous we face is unlike 
any we have seen before.</b>

12:22.420 --> 12:26.290
<b>I only hope these fears of 
mine turn out unfounded.</b>

12:28.670 --> 12:31.000
<b>Attention all those on school grounds.</b>

12:31.580 --> 12:37.830
<b>An unidentified Irous has been spotted
within the residential area.</b>

12:38.420 --> 12:41.130
<b>The Hoshimori team is 
currently engaging with it.</b>

12:38.920 --> 12:43.920
<b>Shinjugamine
Girls’ School</b>

12:41.130 --> 12:46.540
<b>All other students are to remain calm
and follow the directions of their teachers.</b>

12:56.540 --> 12:58.420
<b>Well, well, Hoshimori.</b>

12:58.710 --> 13:01.420
<b>I suppose it will take 
something more to stop you.</b>

13:01.710 --> 13:04.380
<b>Now, how about this then?</b>

13:09.420 --> 13:10.250
<b>What's that?</b>

13:10.250 --> 13:11.330
<b>Everyone fall back!</b>

13:17.580 --> 13:18.670
<b>Misaki!</b>

13:25.380 --> 13:26.380
<b>Shoot!</b>

13:46.790 --> 13:48.170
<b>But why...?</b>

13:48.170 --> 13:51.380
<b>It should have returned to its 
slumber after that attack...</b>

13:51.380 --> 13:56.250
<b>Well, judging by the scope of that explosion,
it probably saved some of its energy.</b>

13:56.580 --> 13:58.880
<b>No one told us it could do that.</b>

13:59.250 --> 14:00.710
<b>Where are Misaki and the others?</b>

14:09.330 --> 14:12.210
<b>That was maybe just a little too close.</b>

14:19.710 --> 14:21.750
<b>What's the situation? Is everyone okay?!</b>

14:22.170 --> 14:24.290
<b>Renge and Nozomi are injured.</b>

14:24.830 --> 14:27.080
<b>We need a teleportation 
route for both of them.</b>

14:27.080 --> 14:28.920
<b>Roger that! We'll be right on it!</b>

14:29.080 --> 14:30.920
<b>Furan, how's the evacuation moving?</b>

14:30.920 --> 14:34.080
<b>Thankfully our evacuation is fully complete.</b>

14:34.420 --> 14:39.420
<b>Thanks to the Holy Tree, the school and
the area around here should hold up, but...</b>

14:41.920 --> 14:47.790
<b>If we don't stop its charge we'll be facing
massive-scale destruction</b>

14:47.790 --> 14:49.540
<b>and will have to abandon the city.</b>

14:49.880 --> 14:51.080
<b>Abandon it...?</b>

14:52.710 --> 14:55.000
<b>Serizawa! Amano! Are you all right?</b>

14:55.250 --> 14:56.960
<b>Barely...</b>

14:56.960 --> 14:59.750
<b>It got us good...</b>

14:59.750 --> 15:00.580
<b>Sir!</b>

15:00.580 --> 15:02.330
<b>Get them both to the med bay!</b>

15:20.710 --> 15:21.630
<b>The electricity...</b>

15:22.080 --> 15:23.540
<b>Fret not.</b>

15:23.540 --> 15:26.170
<b>The generators should kick in any moment.</b>

15:34.750 --> 15:35.960
<b>I'll stop it.</b>

15:39.080 --> 15:40.580
<b>I absolutely will...</b>

15:40.960 --> 15:42.790
<b>I will defeat that thing!</b>

15:49.580 --> 15:50.710
<b>Hoshitsuki?</b>

15:53.040 --> 15:54.170
<b>Hey, stop right there!</b>

15:54.290 --> 15:56.210
<b>We've already suffered casualties.</b>

15:56.790 --> 15:59.420
<b>We should let the city fall and retreat.</b>

16:00.460 --> 16:02.040
<b>I'll never give up.</b>

16:03.130 --> 16:07.210
<b>I can't turn my back on this home of ours.</b>

16:07.420 --> 16:09.710
<b>This is no time for that sort of talk...!</b>

16:09.710 --> 16:10.830
<b>Miki!</b>

16:11.710 --> 16:13.210
<b>Miki!</b>

16:14.130 --> 16:16.000
<b>Miki!</b>

16:16.630 --> 16:18.250
<b>Are you okay?</b>

16:21.290 --> 16:23.250
<b>Mayu!</b>

16:23.250 --> 16:24.880
<b>Kei!</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:30.750
<b>Hurry up and go show that thing what's what!</b>

16:30.750 --> 16:34.250
<b>Then we can go get some of that
Popping Cream special double scoop!</b>

16:34.250 --> 16:37.170
<b>Hoshitsuki! Go get 'em!</b>

16:37.420 --> 16:40.380
<b>Don't lose to those stinkin' Irous!</b>

16:40.750 --> 16:44.330
<b>We know you can do it!</b>

16:44.630 --> 16:46.630
<b>You can do it!</b>

16:51.580 --> 16:53.290
<b>You know what else, Misaki?</b>

16:56.290 --> 16:58.130
<b>The Hoshimori team...</b>

16:58.750 --> 17:01.380
<b>we're a ray of hope for everyone!</b>

17:04.500 --> 17:06.210
<b>Be a ray of hope...</b>

17:09.130 --> 17:10.630
<b>I'm heading back!</b>

17:15.250 --> 17:16.580
<b>What's this...?</b>

17:24.670 --> 17:27.750
<b>Go girls... Good luck!</b>

17:31.580 --> 17:34.040
<b>Sheesh, we can't even 
get close to that thing.</b>

17:34.380 --> 17:38.750
<b>But we've got to do something 
or else the town will...</b>

17:58.830 --> 18:01.460
<b>What the? What's this light...?</b>

18:04.210 --> 18:05.670
<b>It's so warm.</b>

18:05.670 --> 18:08.130
<b>My body hardly hurts anymore.</b>

18:10.880 --> 18:12.170
<b>Is this...</b>

18:15.290 --> 18:16.580
<b>It's warm...</b>

18:23.540 --> 18:25.880
<b>The power of the Holy Tree...</b>

18:53.790 --> 18:54.710
<b>Miki...</b>

18:54.710 --> 18:57.080
<b>What the? What's with this glow?</b>

18:57.080 --> 18:59.830
<b>It's ever so warm.</b>

19:00.130 --> 19:01.960
<b>I feel super re-energized!</b>

19:02.830 --> 19:10.000
<b>Now Hoshimori girls, do let me see
my ambition out would you?</b>

19:15.170 --> 19:17.670
<b>Everyone group up for one focused attack!</b>

19:17.670 --> 19:18.830
<b>Roger!</b>

19:56.540 --> 19:57.670
<b>Misaki?!</b>

19:57.960 --> 20:00.250
<b>Ready? We only have one shot!</b>

20:01.420 --> 20:03.210
<b>Okay, do it!</b>

20:05.880 --> 20:06.880
<b>Here goes!</b>

20:30.040 --> 20:32.000
<b>H-hooray!</b>

20:34.580 --> 20:36.250
<b>That was really something.</b>

20:37.130 --> 20:38.750
<b>What's that light?</b>

20:39.040 --> 20:40.540
<b>It's Miki and the others!</b>

20:40.540 --> 20:42.710
<b>The Hoshimori girls did it!</b>

20:43.920 --> 20:46.080
<b>We did it, Misaki!</b>

20:51.000 --> 20:52.000
<b>Yeah...</b>

21:07.960 --> 21:09.500
<b>Miki!</b>

21:09.960 --> 21:11.290
<b>Mayu!</b>

21:11.290 --> 21:12.250
<b>Kei!</b>

21:13.830 --> 21:15.540
<b>We're so glad you're okay!</b>

21:16.330 --> 21:18.210
<b>You sure you aren't hurt?</b>

21:18.210 --> 21:19.250
<b>Of course not!</b>

21:19.250 --> 21:20.330
<b>Really?</b>

21:20.580 --> 21:21.750
<b>I'm fine!</b>

21:21.830 --> 21:23.080
<b>Really really?!</b>

21:23.080 --> 21:24.420
<b>Good work girls.</b>

21:24.420 --> 21:26.290
<b>That was truly amazing!</b>

21:26.290 --> 21:28.080
<b>Thanks, Misaki!</b>

21:28.080 --> 21:30.540
<b>Hmm, I guess I'll thank you 
for this time, at least.</b>

21:30.540 --> 21:31.630
<b>Thanks.</b>

21:36.000 --> 21:41.920
<b>I... don't think I ever realized
the true power of the Hoshimori team.</b>

21:42.830 --> 21:45.170
<b>The... true power?</b>

21:45.460 --> 21:46.290
<b>Yes...</b>

21:50.790 --> 21:55.040
<b>The stars are beautiful here, too... Sis.</b>

22:12.460 --> 22:18.920
<b>Things should be moving, 
but they feel stopped</b>

22:18.920 --> 22:25.250
<b>I contemplate alone, pretending to understand</b>

22:25.250 --> 22:31.670
<b>But with the end of each 
twinkle reason draws away</b>

22:31.670 --> 22:37.460
<b>Reflected in my pupils as running noise</b>

22:37.460 --> 22:44.000
<b>Consciousness trapped 
away in a lonely rondeau</b>

22:44.250 --> 22:47.670
<b>When it's held up, make your escape</b>

22:47.670 --> 22:53.040
<b>And let us perform together</b>

22:53.170 --> 23:00.000
<b>There's no one to decide but you yourself</b>

23:00.000 --> 23:06.170
<b>Whether right or wrong, it 
will all start to seem fine</b>

23:06.170 --> 23:12.960
<b>One over the other, if you believe 
it will come true someday</b>

23:12.960 --> 23:21.790
<b>The blank music score will be 
filled with a one of a kind</b>

23:22.040 --> 23:25.040
<b>Ring out melody</b>

23:26.500 --> 23:28.000
<b>Kaede, what's the matter?</b>

23:28.000 --> 23:29.250
<b>Whatever do you mean?</b>

23:29.250 --> 23:31.210
<b>Behind you. Is that thing with you?</b>

23:31.210 --> 23:34.380
<b>Wait just a moment! You don't mean...?!</b>

23:34.380 --> 23:36.750
<b>Next time: "Hoshimori Downtime"!</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:41.000
<b>Next Episode
Hoshimori Downtime
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

23:38.630 --> 23:40.460
<b>It's a ghost!</b>
